    "case_for": "My configuration is unchanged. B014 presents a sufficiently delimited biological and technological advance whose medical result is prevention of HPV infection and related cancers. The supplied record supports mature immunogenicity, broad implementation, and population-level relevance. Lowy, Frazer, and Schiller remain a coherent maximum-three allocation for the VLP-vaccine advance, provided the citation is confined to that advance rather than to HPV causation or the entire subsequent delivery enterprise.",
